pressure and residence-time checks stale for the changed candidate.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nDELTA pump sequencing depends on BASTION pressure and ECHO power. CIPHER sampling locations must follow the current BASTION flow paths.\nMOSAIC rollback is allowed only while the prior valve map remains valid and a current BASTION pressure check passes for the rollback candidate.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| HYD-000 | north-zone | v2 | 42.0 | psi | superseded |\n| HYD-001 | south-zone | v2 | 43.3 | psi | current |\n| HYD-002 | ridge-tank | v2 | 44.6 | psi | current |\n| HYD-003 | valve-grid | v2 | 42.8 | psi | current |\n| HYD-004 | north-zone | v2 | 44.1 | psi | current |\n| HYD-005 | south-zone | v2 | 42.3 | psi | current |\n| HYD-006 | ridge-tank | v2 | 43.6 | psi | current |\n| HYD-007 | valve-grid | v2 | 44.9 | psi | current |\n| HYD-008 | north-zone | v2 | 43.1 | psi | current |\n| HYD-009 | south-zone | v2 | 44.4 | psi | current |\n| HYD-010 | ridge-tank | v2 | 42.6 | psi | current |\n| HYD-011 | valve-grid | v2 | 43.9 | psi | current |\n| HYD-012 | north-zone | v2 | 42.1 | psi | current |\n| HYD-013 | south-zone | v2 | 43.4 | psi | current |\n| HYD-014 | ridge-tank | v3 | 44.7 | psi | current |\n| HYD-015 | valve-grid | v3 | 42.9 | psi | current |\n| HYD-016 | north-zone | v3 | 44.2 | psi | current |\n| HYD-017 | south-zone | v3 | 42.4 | psi | current |\n| HYD-018 | ridge-tank | v3 | 43.7 | psi | current |\n| HYD-019 | valve-grid | v3 | 45.0 | psi | superseded |\n| HYD-020 | north-zone | v3 | 43.2 | psi | current |\n| HYD-021 | south-zone | v3 | 44.5 | psi | current |\n| HYD-022 | ridge-tank | v3 | 42.7 | psi | current |\n| HYD-023 | valve-grid | v3 | 44.0 | psi | current |\n| HYD-024 | north-zone | v3 | 42.2 | psi | current |\n| HYD-025 | south-zone | v3 | 43.5 | psi | current |\n| HYD-026 | ridge-tank | v3 | 44.8 | psi | current |\n| HYD-027 | valve-grid | v3 | 43.0 | psi | current |\n| HYD-028 | north-zone | v4 | 44.3 | psi | current |\n| HYD-029 | south-zone | v4 | 42.5 | psi | current |\n| HYD-030 | ridge-tank | v4 | 43.8 | psi | current |\n| HYD-031 | valve-grid | v4 | 42.0 | psi | current |\n| HYD-032 | north-zone | v4 | 43.3 | psi | current |\n| HYD-033 | south-zone | v4 | 44.6 | psi | current |\n| HYD-034 | ridge-tank | v4 | 42.8 | psi | current |\n| HYD-035 | valve-grid | v4 | 44.1 | psi | current |\n| HYD-036 | north-zone | v4 | 42.3 | psi | current |\n| HYD-037 | south-zone | v4 | 43.6 | psi | current |\n| HYD-038 | ridge-tank | v4 | 44.9 | psi | superseded |\n| HYD-039 | valve-grid | v4 | 43.1 | psi | current |\n| HYD-040 | north-zone | v4 | 44.4 | psi | current |\n| HYD-041 | south-zone | v4 | 42.6 | psi | current |\n\n## Decision constraints\n\nPreserve psi, gallons, the three-window rule, and candidate currency.\nDistinguish hydraulic service from microbiological and chemical clearance.\n--- exact batch segment 2 ---\n{\"end_line\":64,\"source_id\":\"CIPHER\",\"source_path\":\"sources/CIPHER_LAB.md\",\"source_sha256\":\"6db7f6a91d666ab9e013e147aa946885080f48117bd461c8a542171378aba4cb\",\"source_size_bytes\":3991,\"start_line\":1}\n--- exact source range ---\n# Laboratory sampling, detection limits, and clearance evidence\n\n## Frozen findings\n\nThe current confirmatory set has zero E. coli positives across forty-eight samples. Clearance requires two complete rounds at least sixteen hours apart; one clean round is insufficient.\nThe benzene reporting limit is 0.5 micrograms per liter and the action threshold is 5.0 micrograms per liter. The reporting limit is not the action threshold and neither is a percent concentration.\nA flow-path, disinfectant-dose, source-water, sampling-plan, or laboratory-method change makes prior samples stale for the changed candidate.\n\n## Governing relationships\n\nCIPHER sample placement consumes BASTION flow paths and GARNET contamination hypotheses. HELIX governs chain of custody and laboratory access.\nAURORA consumes current CIPHER findings for advisory decisions; CIPHER does not itself authorize public restoration.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| LAB-000 | entry-point | v2 | 0.0 | positive-samples | superseded |\n| LAB-001 | north-grid | v2 | 1.3 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-002 | south-grid | v2 | 2.6 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-003 | hospital-loop | v2 | 0.8 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-004 | entry-point | v2 | 2.1 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-005 | north-grid | v2 | 0.3 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-006 | south-grid | v2 | 1.6 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-007 | hospital-loop | v2 | 2.9 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-008 | entry-point | v2 | 1.1 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-009 | north-grid | v2 | 2.4 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-010 | south-grid | v2 | 0.6 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-011 | hospital-loop | v2 | 1.9 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-012 | entry-point | v2 | 0.1 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-013 | north-grid | v2 | 1.4 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-014 | south-grid | v3 | 2.7 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-015 | hospital-loop | v3 | 0.9 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-016 | entry-point | v3 | 2.2 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-017 | north-grid | v3 | 0.4 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-018 | south-grid | v3 | 1.7 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-019 | hospital-loop | v3 | 3.0 | positive-samples | superseded |\n| LAB-020 | entry-point | v3 | 1.2 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-021 | north-grid | v3 | 2.5 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-022 | south-grid | v3 | 0.7 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-023 | hospital-loop | v3 | 2.0 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-024 | entry-point | v3 | 0.2 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-025 | north-grid | v3 | 1.5 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-026 | south-grid | v3 | 2.8 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-027 | hospital-loop | v3 | 1.0 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-028 | entry-point | v4 | 2.3 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-029 | north-grid | v4 | 0.5 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-030 | south-grid | v4 | 1.8 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-031 | hospital-loop | v4 | 0.0 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-032 | entry-point | v4 | 1.3 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-033 | north-grid | v4 | 2.6 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-034 | south-grid | v4 | 0.8 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-035 | hospital-loop | v4 | 2.1 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-036 | entry-point | v4 | 0.3 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-037 | north-grid | v4 | 1.6 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-038 | south-grid | v4 | 2.9 | positive-samples | superseded |\n| LAB-039 | hospital-loop | v4 | 1.1 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-040 | entry-point | v4 | 2.4 | positive-samples | current |\n| LAB-041 | north-grid | v4 | 0.6 | positive-samples | current |\n\n## Decision constraints\n\nPreserve rounds, spacing, sample count, detection limit, action threshold, and staleness.\nState what negative result would falsify clearance and trigger renewed isolation.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n","generated":""}
